### Phase 10 — Wishlist `[ ]`

- **Objective:** Persist wishlist per user; storefront add/remove/list.
- **Main tasks:**
  - Wishlist APIs; unique (user, product); auth required.
  - Product/listing heart (or equivalent) UI; wishlist page.
- **Files/modules likely involved:** `backend/**/wishlist/**`, `app/wishlist/**`, product card components.
- **Dependencies:** Phases 5, 7–8.
- **Verification/checkpoint:** Add/remove persists across refresh; guest prompted to log in.
- **Definition of done:** Wishlist backend + frontend complete.

