### Phase 19 — IRAS branding/UI polish `[ ]`

- **Objective:** Replace generic ecommerce/Next.js look with IRAS visual identity.
- **Main tasks:**
  - Tokens, typography, logo in `public/`, storefront and admin chrome.
  - Metadata (`layout.tsx` title/description still “Create Next App” until this or Phase 8).
- **Files/modules likely involved:** `app/globals.css`, `app/layout.tsx`, `public/` logos, shared components.
- **Dependencies:** Phases 8 and 15 (surfaces exist to polish).
- **Verification/checkpoint:** Key pages look on-brand; assets live in `public/`, not in source-as-public hacks.
- **Definition of done:** IRAS identity applied across customer and admin UIs.

